.TH ONEDRIVE-BACKUP 8 "November 2026" "onedrive-backup 0.1.1" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
onedrive-backup \- encrypted snapshots of Microsoft OneDrive Business
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B onedrive-backup
[--config /path/to/config.json] {init|backup|snapshots|check} [--dry-run]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Synchronizes a OneDrive remote to a local mirror using rclone. On successful sync,
stores an encrypted restic snapshot and applies a snapshot retention policy.
The timer is deliberately disabled until configured.
.SH CONFIGURATION
Default configuration: /etc/onedrive-backup/config.json .
Restic password and rclone configuration are stored separately outside the package.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B onedrive-backup init
.br
.B onedrive-backup backup --dry-run
.br
.B onedrive-backup backup
.br
.B onedrive-backup snapshots
.br
.B onedrive-backup check
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rclone (1),
.BR restic (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
